 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. C,H,E are collinear [08] & A,E,B are collinear [02] & C,E,G are collinear [06] & CE ⟂ AB [03] ⇒  ∠HEA = ∠AEG [10]
002. A,E,B are collinear [02] & AB ⟂ CE [03] ⇒  AE ⟂ CE [11]
003. C,D,B are collinear [00] & AD ⟂ BC [01] ⇒  AD ⟂ CD [12]
004. AE ⟂ CE [11] & AD ⟂ CD [12] ⇒  ∠EAD = ∠ECD [13]
005. FA = FC [04] & FH = FC [09] & FA = FB [05] ⇒  C,A,H,B are concyclic [14]
006. C,A,H,B are concyclic [14] ⇒  ∠CHA = ∠CBA [15]
007. A,E,B are collinear [02] & D,A,G are collinear [07] & ∠EAD = ∠ECD [13] & C,D,B are collinear [00] & ∠CHA = ∠CBA [15] & C,E,H are collinear [08] ⇒  ∠HAE = ∠EAG [16]
008. ∠HEA = ∠AEG [10] & ∠HAE = ∠EAG [16] (Similar Triangles)⇒  EH = EG
